Z||000004||Fret Naught||05-07-2000||09:02 PM||||Just got back from my cruise, had a great time, my dear sweet wife looked at me kind of funny when I asked her to go she said no, (I knew she would) so asked my 13 yr. old daughter she couldn't wait. We ran about 200 miles of windy mountain roads, the faster I took the corners the wider her grin. Chip off the old block (head) he he. I can not believe how well these things corner. what a riot. Oh yeah and I sun burned the sh!! out of my head not much hair up there, and didn't think about the sun roof. Took some Pics when I get them back I will post them.||||reg||7
